name: Dependency exports keep source records distinct and disclose graph omissions
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_cyclonedx.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | inventory-origin
expect: Commands
expect-not: shell route
expect-not: focus unknown
submit: run sbom-scan:scan
require-live-snap: 30 SPDX and CycloneDX omitted 3 dependency relationships | inventory-result
expect: sbom-scan: 5 components
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_cyclonedx.py @TMP_TARGET @ART initial
resize: 160x48
live-snap: warning-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: warning-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: warning-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: warning-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: warning-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | warning-expanded-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: warning-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: warning-page-2-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_cyclonedx.py @TMP_TARGET @ART warning-pages
ask: Are both exports explicit about skipped relationships, and is the complete warning readable by keyboard at every supported size?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI VIZ | inventory-gallery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT STACK | inventory-components
expect: library
expect: other
expect: declared ^1.0
expect: declared ^3.0
expect: 3 resolved
expect: 2 manifests · 1 lockfile
expect-not: 1 lockfiles
expect: Source freshness is unverified
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
resize: 160x48
live-snap: components-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: components-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: components-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: components-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: components-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: components-page-6-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI VIZ | restart-gallery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 declared ^1.0 | restart-components
expect: library
expect: other
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sbom_cyclonedx.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain five component records and both incomplete exports, with declared constraints separate from observed versions and no new model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
